    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9dcff47e93403f2c65e686",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻顺利取得了第一名，\n她的表情却没有喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "292e721423f79a047c5504c20220ce91bc2d6f1eb4795dda753fcfd096594037",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be5b260be9ec96c11942dd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛的最后阶段因为脚步沉重\n而没能跑出满意的表现。她因此认为\n自己的表现不符合“知名赛马娘”而沮丧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8211f986d1dae7ce44eabb5cb08c47bbd431a8f68f92761f20140ef3cfa38465",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90aff0d5433415180ce0189",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "疲劳的原因是因为路况拥塞导致差点迟到，\n她只好亲自下车跑到赛场而造成的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38992836840abc6b897e12d58d9f997ef59ac47a06bdf9e5ae3169fc7212866d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920edf352cd5c5d2b824e7b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻甚至开始怀疑\n这一切或许都跟魔咒有关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "550ec444a063a78a5dcca1b0c4ecf62d4f3f9d17e4654861da8ab637c439add6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c769c94ea913ff53342c709a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是便打起精神，\n决心要在下一场“日本德比”中战胜魔咒，\n以最完美的表现赢得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4401ed120c9b5fe4b2a83156f1ec65a11b348902a13d7fe79deff8f9e1e96e75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2881465a7f5d2f5c6d273396",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・厄运",
